{
  "_doc": [
    "classes: shared behaviour per mechanism. weapons: every in-game weapon (internal name -> hash = joaat(name)),",
    "with its class, sound bank and per-gun differences in 'tune' (deep-merged over the class).",
    "Trigger travel = 10 zones (0 rest .. 9 fully pressed); force 1-8 per zone, 0 = free.",
    "fire.curve        resistance before the break; with engine=feedback every zone from break_zone on is free,",
    "                  so the wall ending at break_zone IS the break and the shot fires exactly there",
    "fire.engine       feedback | weapon (Sony snap, weapon_effect=[start,end,strength]) | hybrid | simple_weapon",
    "fire.empty        click = same pull, hammer falls on nothing | dead = slide/bolt held open, no wall, no click",
    "fire.ticks        tactile events while pulling (double-action cylinder lock-up)",
    "fire.grit         0-1 creep texture felt only while the trigger moves",
    "recoil            lock_ms (break -> shot), haptic recipe, trigger kick envelope (upper bound when derived from audio)",
    "audio             convert preset for the game's own shot recording, pan (-1 left hand .. +1 right hand), synth_mix",
    "action            RDR2 cycles single-action hammers, levers, bolts and pumps with an R2 tap between shots",
    "rate_ms / clip    estimates - the mod reads the real values from the game",
    "verified          true = name hash seen in the running game or in existing mods' tables"
  ],
